# IncidentMind production backend — Hindsight API (slim variant) for Render free tier.
#
# Why slim: the full image bundles local embedding (~130MB) + reranker (~90MB)
# models and their PyTorch/ONNX runtimes (1.5GB+ RAM); it OOM-kills Render's
# 512MB free plan. The slim image delegates embeddings/reranking to external
# providers and needs an external PostgreSQL — all wired here at ₹0:
#   - LLM:        Gemini free tier (AI Studio key; Groq's free tier caps at
#                 8k TPM while a single Hindsight retain needs ~64k)
#   - Embeddings: Gemini embedding API (same free key)
#   - Reranker:   rrf (no neural model, minimal resources)
#   - Database:   the same free Render Postgres as the app, schema-separated
FROM ghcr.io/vectorize-io/hindsight-api:latest-slim
